   "content": "<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">尊敬的用户：</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">为进一步优化服务品质，更好保障广大用户的使用感受，配合移动高清业务升级更新，自2026年11月15日0点起，将对“移动高清IPTV基础包10”等104个移动高清电视大屏权益产品进行下线处理。</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">本次下线的产品清单请见附录。</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">因业务调整给您带来不便，敬请谅解，感谢您一直以来对中国移动的支持！</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><a href=\"https://www.10086.cn/uploadBaseDir/content/xlsx/20261010/20261010173404137yUZ.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\" download=\"下线移动高清电视大屏权益产品明细.xlsx\">下线移动高清电视大屏权益产品明细.xlsx</a><br>\n</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">中国移动通信集团湖南有限公司</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">2026年10月10日</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
